flowchart TD

FromOverview[↩ From Fig. 1 — Guest Mode / Registered User Login]:::connector

EnterQuery[/Enter Natural-Language Query and Search Filters/]:::guest
SubmitSearch[Submit Search]:::guest
ValidateInput{Search Input Valid?}:::decisionNode
InputError[Display Input Error Message]:::errorNode
SemanticProcess[[Convert Query to Vector, Calculate Semantic Similarity, Apply Filters and Rank Results]]:::semantic
HasResults{Matching Accommodation Found?}:::decisionNode
NoResults[Display 'No Matching Accommodation Found']:::errorNode
DisplayResults[/Display Search Results/]:::guest
ViewDetails[/View Accommodation Details/]:::guest
ViewMap[View Location on Map]:::guest
ShareInfo[Share Accommodation Information]:::guest
CheckLogin{Registered User Logged In?}:::decisionNode
FinishViewing[Finish Viewing Information]:::guest
ToLogin[↪ Fig. 3 — Login or Register to Continue]:::connector
End((End)):::startend

FromOverview --> EnterQuery
EnterQuery --> SubmitSearch --> ValidateInput
ValidateInput -->|No| InputError --> EnterQuery
ValidateInput -->|Yes| SemanticProcess --> HasResults
HasResults -->|No| NoResults --> EnterQuery
HasResults -->|Yes| DisplayResults --> ViewDetails
ViewDetails --> ViewMap --> FinishViewing --> End
ViewDetails --> ShareInfo --> FinishViewing
ViewDetails --> CheckLogin
CheckLogin -->|No| ToLogin

subgraph MEMBER["Registered User Functions"]
    direction TB
    Favorites[Save and Manage Favorites]:::member
    History[View Search History and Recently Viewed]:::member
    Compare[Compare Selected Accommodations]:::member
    Recommend[View Personalized Recommendations]:::member
    Profile[Manage Personal Information]:::member
    Logout[Logout]:::member
end

CheckLogin -->|Yes| Favorites
CheckLogin -->|Yes| History
CheckLogin -->|Yes| Compare
CheckLogin -->|Yes| Recommend
CheckLogin -->|Yes| Profile
Favorites --> Logout
History --> Logout
Compare --> Logout
Recommend --> Logout
Profile --> Logout
Logout --> End

